---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="About TempoEmails"
  description="About TempoEmails — our mission to provide free, anonymous disposable email addresses (10-minute mail, 24h burner inboxes) with instant OTP verification and zero logs worldwide."
  keywords="free temp mail generator us, best temp mail service uk, temporary mail generator europe gdpr compliant, reliable temp mail generator us hosted, anonymous temporary inbox no log, privacy focused disposable email provider"
>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    In an era where every website, application, download link, and online forum demands your personal email address, digital privacy has never been more vulnerable. <strong>TempoEmails</strong> was founded on a simple yet unyielding principle: <em>your personal inbox belongs to you, and your privacy should never be the price of exploring the web.</em>
  </p>

  <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[#ea2804] pl-4 italic text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400 mb-4">
    "We believe privacy is a fundamental human right. TempoEmails exists to give everyone an effortless, instant shield against spam, tracking, and unsolicited digital clutter."
  </blockquote>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">Our Mission: Reclaiming Your Inbox</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Every time you share your permanent email address to read a gated article, test a new SaaS product, download a whitepaper, or claim a one-time promo code, your address is logged into corporate customer databases. From there, it is frequently synced with tracking pixels, packaged into marketing cohorts, and traded across data broker ecosystems. The result? A relentless influx of spam, marketing newsletters, phishing risks, and unwanted notifications.
  </p>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    TempoEmails breaks this cycle. We provide instant, disposable, temporary email addresses that receive incoming messages on the fly. You verify your account, grab your one-time password (OTP) or confirmation link, and walk away. When you are done, the mailbox expires and every trace of data is permanently wiped from existence.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">What Makes TempoEmails Exceptional?</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    We built TempoEmails because existing temporary email tools were either bloated with intrusive pop-up ads, clunky and slow to refresh, or riddled with broken domain lists that got blocked everywhere. We set out to engineer a premium, modern experience:
  </p>

  <div class="space-y-4 mb-6">
    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10">
      <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-1">⚡ Instant Real-Time Delivery</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400">
        Incoming emails appear in your inbox within seconds. Our optimized polling and push channels ensure you never sit waiting for critical verification codes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10">
      <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-1">🔑 Smart OTP & Verification Code Extraction</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400">
        No need to parse long corporate email bodies. TempoEmails automatically detects and highlights 4-8 digit OTP verification codes with one-click copy functionality.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10">
      <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-1">📱 Seamless QR Code Mobile Transfer</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400">
        Need to sign up on your smartphone while working on your desktop? Scan the generated QR code to immediately open the exact same active inbox on your mobile device.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10">
      <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-1">🌐 Multiple Domain Choices</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400">
        We maintain an active pool of fresh, deliverable domain names to ensure broad compatibility with websites that attempt to filter disposable email services.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-black/5 dark:bg-white/5 border border-black/10 dark:border-white/10">
      <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-1">🌙 Modern, Clean, Dark-Mode Ready UI</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-400">
        Crafted with precision typography, responsive fluid layouts, and automatic dark mode support for comfortable day or night browsing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">Our Core Values</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Every product decision we make is guided by four uncompromising principles:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 mb-4">
    <li><strong>Zero Personal Identification:</strong> We do not ask for your name, phone number, real email, or payment information. When you use TempoEmails, you are anonymous.</li>
    <li><strong>Ephemeral by Design:</strong> Data should not live forever. Messages are automatically wiped from our servers after their short lifespan expires.</li>
    <li><strong>Free and Accessible Worldwide:</strong> Privacy should not be a paid luxury. TempoEmails will remain free and unrestricted for anyone with an internet connection.</li>
    <li><strong>Developer & Tester Friendly:</strong> Built with web developers, QA engineers, and automated testing workflows in mind, making rapid testing painless.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">Under the Hood: Technology & Reliability</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    TempoEmails is built with cutting-edge web technologies, utilizing the <strong>Astro</strong> modern static framework, <strong>Tailwind CSS v4</strong> for lightweight styling, and an elastic backend routing architecture. Our infrastructure leverages redundant upstream mail servers and distributed edge networks to ensure lightning-fast page loading and resilient 99.9% uptime.
  </p>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    We continuously monitor domain reputation, deliverability benchmarks, and spam prevention protocols to ensure that emails sent to your temporary inboxes arrive without delay.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">Our Commitment to User Privacy</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    We operate with absolute transparency. We do not sell user data, track users across different internet domains, or maintain hidden surveillance profiles. To learn more about our data handling protocols and cookie policies, please review our comprehensive <a href="/privacy-policy" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/terms-of-service" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">Terms of Service</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#202020] dark:text-[#fcfcfc] mb-4 mt-8">Get in Touch</h2>
  <p class="text-base text-[#575757] dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
    Have questions, feature suggestions, or feedback? We are constantly improving TempoEmails and would love to hear from you. Visit our <a href="/contact" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">Contact Us page</a> or email our team directly at <a href="mailto:contact@tempoemails.dev" class="text-[#ea2804] hover:underline">contact@tempoemails.dev</a>.
  </p>
</ContentLayout>
